1
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,519
You look a little sallow.

2
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,800
Didn't sleep well last night?

3
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,719
Thanks for your concern, Huan.

4
00:00:31,039 --> 00:00:32,399
I slept great last night.

5
00:00:38,359 --> 00:00:39,240
Ms. Song Cheng.

6
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,079
Ms. Song Huan,

7
00:00:45,079 --> 00:00:46,719
Mr. Song is waiting for you
at the office.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,462
=Dear Song=

9
00:00:57,612 --> 00:00:59,759
=Episode 16=
(Who's the Prey?)

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,799
Yeah.

11
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,719
Not bad.

12
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,599
You can get back to work.

13
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,400
Something else?

14
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,920
Dad.

15
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:19,640
Early-stage construction
on the hot spring hotel

16
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,120
is progressing efficiently.

17
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,959
And the main structure

18
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,400
can be finished on schedule.

19
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,040
What are you getting at?

20
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,560
Song Group's

21
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,920
vice president position

22
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:40,519
has been vacant for a long time.

23
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:41,920
Looks like

24
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:44,519
you've had your eye on it
for a long time.

25
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,120
I think I deserve it.

26
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,280
Finishing on time

27
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,519
doesn't prove anything.

28
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:57,719
Okay.

29
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:59,239
One week.

30
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:00,760
Give me one week.

31
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:02,640
I can finish ahead of schedule.

32
00:02:03,159 --> 00:02:04,799
If you can't finish early,

33
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:07,640
I can give the vice president position
to whoever I want,

34
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,319
and you don't get a say.

35
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,159
Deal.

36
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,759
Ms. Song Huan,

37
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:31,560
with the current resources
and construction conditions,

38
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,719
finishing a week early

39
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:34,360
is way too risky.

40
00:02:38,039 --> 00:02:38,879
The company hired you

41
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:40,599
to solve problems,

42
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:42,639
not to list obstacles.

43
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:45,360
If I have to do everything myself,

44
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:47,719
what am I

45
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:49,039
paying you for?

46
00:02:52,039 --> 00:02:53,240
I want a new plan

47
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,000
in three hours.

48
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,280
Or else,

49
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,759
you know the consequences.

50
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:02,639
Yes.

51
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:04,240
Let's go.

52
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,400
When did you prepare this?

53
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,120
Five days out of seven,

54
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,120
you're out drinking for work.

55
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,960
I was worried, so I had it ready.

56
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,639
If only those idiots

57
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:44,719
were even half as capable as you.

58
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,560
Ms. Song Huan,

59
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:52,199
do you want to run this
by Mr. Song again?

60
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,280
This deadline

61
00:03:54,479 --> 00:03:55,560
is really hard to hit.

62
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:59,439
I'm here to do
what you ordinary people can't.

63
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,879
You can go now.

64
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,919
Alright.

65
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,719
Call me if you need anything.

66
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,120
Song Huan managed to shorten

67
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,759
the main structure timeline that much.

68
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:38,160
On the surface, it's because

69
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:40,360
the crews are running three shifts
and working overtime.

70
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,759
But actually,

71
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:43,399
labor costs the least.

72
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:45,000
The real key

73
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,360
is the workflow.

74
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,639
You're saying

75
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,639
Song Huan cut corners?

76
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,800
Just a guess.

77
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,560
Song Group

78
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:58,319
got where it is today on real merit.

79
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,720
If something does go wrong,

80
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,480
all the trust and reputation it built

81
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,720
will go up in smoke.

82
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:06,319
Song Huan has always wanted
the vice president position.

83
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,319
But all these years,

84
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:08,560
Song Huaishan never let her have it.

85
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:10,519
No matter what she did,

86
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,360
he never thought she was good enough.

87
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:14,040
That's exactly why

88
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,560
she wants to do better
than everyone else.

89
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,160
What she really wants isn't the title.

90
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,600
It's to prove him wrong.

91
00:05:23,399 --> 00:05:23,800
Huh?

92
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,800
Song Huan is like this

93
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,839
because of what she lacked as a kid.

94
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:30,560
And there's a good chance

95
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:33,000
this time she'll go all in

96
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,199
for the vice president position.

97
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,120
Then something could very well go wrong.

98
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,680
Right.

99
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,519
And when she runs into trouble,

100
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,720
that's our chance.

101
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,439
Hello, Ms. Song Huan.

102
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:52,480
(I have to go abroad
on a last-minute business trip.)

103
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,399
(Keep an eye)

104
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:54,560
(on the project.)

105
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,959
Alright, got it.

106
00:05:55,959 --> 00:05:56,959
Do you need a ride?

107
00:05:56,959 --> 00:05:57,600
(No.)

108
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,319
(I'm boarding now.)

109
00:06:00,984 --> 00:06:02,277
(General Office)

110
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,759
(Rushing the project
by cutting corners.)

111
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,959
(The risk is obvious.)

112
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:17,000
(Song Huan,)

113
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:20,040
(I won't just stand by
while the Song family puts profit)

114
00:06:20,519 --> 00:06:21,800
(Ready-Mixed Concrete Delivery Ticket)
(over human life.)

115
00:06:21,888 --> 00:06:22,941
(Anshi SCZ Dongcheng Concrete Co., Ltd.
Ready-Mixed Concrete Delivery Ticket)

116
00:06:35,639 --> 00:06:37,639
Still working this late,

117
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,240
Ms. Yu?

118
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,600
Ms. Song Huan.

119
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:53,839
Weren't you on a business trip?

120
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:57,240
Did you really want me gone that badly?

121
00:06:57,959 --> 00:07:00,160
So you told me you were away on business

122
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,839
just to let me snoop around?

123
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,439
Like I told you before,

124
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:07,959
I never really trust anyone.

125
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:09,560
Especially

126
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,480
someone smart like you.

127
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,079
You've been testing me

128
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,639
this whole time?

129
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,399
You're smart,

130
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:35,639
you know how to bide your time,

131
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,360
and when to seize an opportunity.

132
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,279
You're a lot like me back then.

133
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:44,439
Too bad

134
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:48,240
a knockoff is still a knockoff.

135
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,279
I taught you this.

136
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,040
To win,

137
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,439
you always have to think

138
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:58,079
three steps ahead of your opponent.

139
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:01,279
But you

140
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,279
only thought one step ahead.

141
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:05,920
Why don't you take a look

142
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:08,360
at the contract you're holding?

143
00:08:13,287 --> 00:08:16,800
(Song Group: Song Huan
Authorized Representative: Yu Song)

144
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:20,560
Talk.

145
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,519
What are you really after at Song Group?

146
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,839
Otherwise, by tomorrow,

147
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:31,800
everyone will know you, Ms. Yu,

148
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:35,639
as the assistant who cut corners,

149
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,440
took bribes, and jumped off a building

150
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,240
out of guilt.

151
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,399
You want me to be your scapegoat?

152
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,240
You're not that dumb.

153
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:50,279
If you'd just stayed put by my side,

154
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,720
none of this would've happened.

155
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,960
But if you've got your own agenda,

156
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,440
every bit of evidence you find

157
00:08:58,720 --> 00:09:00,159
will only get you killed.

158
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,879
What are you laughing at?

159
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:13,840
Ms. Song Huan!

160
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,840
You can't do this!

161
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:17,120
Song Group got where it is today

162
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:19,039
by taking things one step at a time!

163
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:20,559
You can't pull something like this

164
00:09:20,559 --> 00:09:22,320
just to rush the schedule!

165
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:24,519
Song Huan!

166
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,320
What are you doing?

167
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:28,679
Ms. Song Huan, let go of me!

168
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:29,840
Let go!

169
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:44,360
Dad.

170
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:45,440
Song Huan.

171
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,360
Do you have any idea
how much trouble you've caused?

172
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:50,320
For the vice president position,

173
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,759
you actually did something

174
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:53,559
that damaged Song Group's reputation!

175
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,480
Hello?

176
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,279
(Mr. Song,)

177
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,279
(at the construction site,)

178
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:02,879
(a pipe on the hotel's second floor
just burst.)

179
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:04,600
(Luckily, Ms. Yu gave us a heads-up.)

180
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,480
(We were able to fix it in time.)

181
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,639
(No casualties.)

182
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:08,879
I understand.

183
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:12,639
Dad.

184
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,120
What I'm holding

185
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,440
is the original
concrete delivery ticket.

186
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:20,480
I found these discarded original records

187
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:23,240
for stone blocks in the lab waste area.

188
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:25,679
The actual strength doesn't even reach

189
00:10:25,679 --> 00:10:27,159
70% of the design standard.

190
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,519
Dad,

191
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:31,159
the file Yu Song has is fake.

192
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:33,639
Huan used it to frame her.

193
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,519
Song Huan!

194
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:37,039
You still don't regret what you've done?

195
00:10:37,759 --> 00:10:38,919
If someone had died,

196
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:41,120
you would've destroyed
the company's reputation!

197
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,320
If I'd known you'd stop at nothing,

198
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:45,639
I never would've given you the chance.

199
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:47,320
Stop at nothing?

200
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,240
Ever since I was a kid,

201
00:10:50,559 --> 00:10:52,120
no matter what I did

202
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,759
or how well I did it,

203
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:54,200
you never cared about me!

204
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,919
Did you ever really intend to
hand Song Group over to me?

205
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:57,960
Be honest.

206
00:10:58,399 --> 00:11:00,440
If you hadn't lost your son,

207
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:03,360
would I be where I am today?

208
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,279
Shut up!

209
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:06,799
Haven't I

210
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,440
given you enough all these years?

211
00:11:09,639 --> 00:11:11,240
Say one more word,

212
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,480
and you're out of Song Group for good!

213
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,440
This

214
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,159
ends here.

215
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,799
I underestimated you two.

216
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,519
Putting Yu Song by my side

217
00:11:43,039 --> 00:11:44,320
to distract me,

218
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:47,879
so my seemingly unremarkable
younger sister

219
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,120
could get so much done.

220
00:11:56,519 --> 00:11:57,320
Yu Song.

221
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:05,919
Why?

222
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,879
Because she's easy to control?

223
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:30,759
(Ms. Song Cheng,)

224
00:12:31,279 --> 00:12:32,559
(hiding in the corner)

225
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,639
(only lets those picking on you)

226
00:12:34,639 --> 00:12:36,159
(push you around even more.)

227
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:38,279
(How to find your footing
in the Song family,)

228
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,799
(I'm sure you know better than I do.)

229
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,759
Ms. Song Huan came to me.

230
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,399
She told me to destroy
the wooden horse you gave Yu Qixian.

231
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:45,440
So

232
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,360
what are you going to do?

233
00:12:47,879 --> 00:12:49,639
Will you help me set a trap?

234
00:12:52,639 --> 00:12:55,480
(Song Huaishan doesn't care
who works for him.)

235
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,360
(He only cares who's more obedient)

236
00:12:57,559 --> 00:13:00,759
(and who can better maintain
his public image.)

237
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,399
(After that,)

238
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:05,399
(Song Huaishan handed
the hot spring project to Song Cheng.)

239
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:08,000
(The relationship between Song Huaishan
and Song Huan)

240
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:10,320
(is like a tightrope.)

241
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:12,600
(Pull too hard on either side,)

242
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,480
(and it snaps.)

243
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:16,080
(They hold each other up,)

244
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,240
(and they hold each other back.)

245
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,759
(For this father and daughter,)

246
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:20,519
(the real drama is yet to come.)
